[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540059923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100337#issuecomment-2540059923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100337","id":2540059923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XZj0T","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-12T21:35:12Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T21:35:12Z","body":"> At the risk of bikeshedding, I think we might as well just set `-mssse3` that is supported by every CPU that has at least 2 cores. The newest cpu to support it is AMD's \"bobcat\" architecture which is from early 2011.\r\n> \r\n> Every single \"atom\" branded CPU has it too. On the Intel side this makes the oldest required CPU a \"Core 2 duo\" or a 64bit capable P4.\r\n\r\nI would agree too. I propose we do this in two steps so we get an intermediate dev snapshot inbetween for testing purposes, if we need to debug reports of some users having Godot suddenly crash on their old PC.\r\n\r\nThis PR just affects x86_32 in a way that should practically be a no-op.\r\n\r\nThen we can make another PR bumping to ssse3 that will affect both x86_32 and x86_64.\r\nOr would we bump to ssse3 only for x86_64?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540059923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540068512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100337#issuecomment-2540068512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100337","id":2540068512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XZl6g","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-12T21:40:55Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T21:50:24Z","body":"> Then we can make another PR bumping to ssse3 that will affect both x86_32 and x86_64. Or would we bump to ssse3 only for x86_64?\r\n\r\nI'd do both x86_32 and x86_64. There's some reason to want to run a 32bit linux distro in particular on a machine that old. Moving from SSE2 to SSSE3 in practice doesn't really limit the amount of CPUs that can run Godot much either way. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540068512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540144384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100337#issuecomment-2540144384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100337","id":2540144384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XZ4cA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-12T22:34:06Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T22:34:06Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2540144384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]